eless_society；Vængheim 使用 harpy_matriarchy_reform 并信仰 Skaldhyrric。虽然政府名称不同，其 owner 省份都按用户规则作为国家控制。Vængheim 与 Skaldskola 的 historical_friend 只说明历史友好标记，不自行升级为正式联盟或附属。","kind":"attested","sourceIds":["manual:ge26-mod-history-countries-z17-obrtrol-txt","manual:ge26-mod-history-countries-z89-digoveda-txt","manual:ge26-mod-history-countries-z88-vaengheim-txt","manual:ge26-mod-history-countries-z09-skaldskola-txt"],"sourceUrl":"https://gitlab.com/anbennar/anbennar-eu4-dev/-/blob/new-master/history/countries/Z17%20-%20Obrtrol.txt","sourceTitle":"EU4 Gerudia source · history/countries/Z17 - Obrtrol.txt","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"exactYear":null,"earliest":1444,"latest":1444,"observedYear":1444,"basis":"opening-observation"},"dateStatus":"opening-observation","geometryNote":"只增加资料库文字；不由事件、人口、宣称或同名行政州直接更改EU4省份归属。","originRecordId":"manual:ge26-northern-nonhuman-polities-1444","originBatchId":"manual:gerudia-escann-20260918-revised","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/gunpowder-fragmentation-20260920/publications/gerudia-escann-research-batch-20260918-revised-publication.json","manifestSha256":"329dd97fb3929c9b91e44683676e6863c9a1dffbb49ab8ce082f3c9cbe21e940","batchPath":"docs/research/gunpowder-fragmentation-20260920/publications/gerudia-escann-research-batch-20260918-revised-input.json","batchSha256":"f8ef9f623393e2c009dce85fa71934345b56f738b79b65a5d2feb3c9168d1e02","mapActorIds":["Z17","Z89","Z88","Z09"],"publishEvent":true},"sourceLocator":"Z17/Z89/Z88/Z09 country history first 12 lines"},{"id":"setup-Z89","year":1444,"title":"EU4 开局归属","description":"当前研究范围收录 1 省。后续未有节点的地块暂沿用这一归属，并不表示历史上从未变化。","kind":"setup","provinceIds":[2832],"sourceIds":["eu4-setup-v05"]},{"id":"ca09-text-gef26-north-gott-return-1451","year":1451,"endYear":null,"title":"1451：Gott 游历归来，传播外界社会经验","description":"人物页明确记三年游历于1451结束，经验成为Ðigoveða公共教诲的一部分。游历混有变形与神谕传说；其中提及Grombar转型、Crovis入侵，不能据此把成国或战争硬定为1451。与现行Crovis玩法窗口的差异另存研究注记。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:gef26-north-wi